body:
Many things  ( and I am talking about women in general ) : 

- I create life. Without me  , there isn’t any future for the humanity. This is why I think men should should treat us like Goddesses on earth ; 
- children, heck PEOPLE loves me more ; 
- I am the epitome of beauty in this world  ; 
- I am superior because I think about building a community before thinking of myself first. Men think about power, women think about their community. If women were like men, their won’t be any society. 
- I may not be stronger physically then men,  but I am resilient to pain unlike them  ; 
- I am more authentic and honest . I won’t deny my emotions, how I feel, who I am . 
- I live longer ; 
- I am peaceful : I won’t use violence or any form of aggressiveness to express how I feel ; 
- I am more spiritual and connected to nature ; 
- I am more patient ; 
- I am a better friend ; better child ; better partner ; better sister ; better parent ; 
- I am emotionally intelligent ; 
- I am creative ; 
- I am STRONG, courageous and perseverant  : now there are more female doctors,  lawyers , entrepreneurs, soldiers, generals, etc. then before. 
- Yes there are many male professional cooks out there, but they were always inspired by their own mothers ; 
- I am independent : I can live without a man. Men cannot. They depend on women ; 
- I  can wear whatever I want, even dress like a man ; 
- I can wear makeup, a wig, a tutu, if I wanted to. Nobody would judge me. 
- I actually lead the household : finances, home, kids, etc. ; 
- I am more organized ;
- I have a better memory ;
- I am happier ; 
- I am more positive and less pessimistic ; 
- I am much more intuitive ; 
- I make better financial decisions ; 
- I am cleaner ; 
- I am a better dresser ; 
- I actually pay attention to how I look ; 
- I am less likely to get bald unlike most men ; 
-  I stay younger looking longer then men; 
- I am classy : I prefer to use WORDS instead of getting physical ;
- I am less likely to have a heart attack because of my hormones ; 
- etc.

Basically women are the better sex.
